  "title": "Eliminate duplicate package-dist build during onefile/root-drop assembly",
  "status": "running",
  "milestone": null,
  "dependencies": [],
  "acceptance": [
    "Onefile assembly performs one package-dist build while direct root-drop callers still perform their own freshness build.",
    "Root-drop and onefile artifact inventories, launcher behavior, and sealed manifest digests remain equivalent to the baseline.",
    "Clean bootstrap, root-drop, and onefile validators remain green.",
    "External receipt contains at least 30 interleaved AB/BA measurements and 8 A/A controls for the selected build/bootstrap workload, in milliseconds, with failure/timeout samples retained.",
